ADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"209\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"34\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">재학생</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">복학생</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"101\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"64\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">[1학년]</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">[4학년이상]</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"101\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"89\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2.15(화) 10:00 ~</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">2.16(수) 23:59 [2일간]</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"209\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"353\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">∙</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">본인의 해당 학부, 학년, 주․야 구분</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">하여 수강신청</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">∙복</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">수전공자는 학년별 지정된 수강신청 기간에 복수전공의</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> 개설 과목 수강신청 </span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">∙4</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">학년(건축학전공은 5학년) 이상은 본인의 해당 전공과목 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">중 필수과목에</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 한하여 모든 학년의 과목을 수강신청 가능</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">∙</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">재학생에 한하여 수강신청 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(휴학생은 수강 신청 불가)</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">∙수강지도 기간 중 지도교수와 수강상담 및 승인을 받은 학생에 한하여 수강신청 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">미승인자 수강신청 불가)</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">☞ 수강지도제외자 : 2011학년도 복학자․휴학자, 신(편)입생</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDIN