</tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"38\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"127\" colspan=\"3\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;1학기 수강신청 확정일</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"38\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"89\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">3.28(월)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"38\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"353\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">∙1학기 수강신청 확정일(수업일수 1/4)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ 기존에 수강변경일에 변경했던 시기를 2.28일에 전체 변경하고, 3월 변경기간은 2과목으로 제한</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ 역학기 복학자는 2011학년도 1학기 학년으로(2학년이면 17-18일) 수강신청하되, 교과목코드를 입력하여 타학년 수강신청 가능<br></span><br><br>2. 기타 유의사항<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(상세내역은 첨부물 참조)</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -58.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 58.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">반드시 수강신청 안내문 및 첨부물을 숙지한 후 신청</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">하시기 바랍니다</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -58.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 58.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 수강과목 관련</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -58.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 58.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">∙ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">확률및통계 과목은 2학년 과목이나, 전자 및 산업공학부는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1학년 수강신청 가능<br>&nbsp;\n</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -58.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 58.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ∙ 미술의이해 과목은 3학년 과목이나, 건축학전공은 2학년 필수로 수강신청 가능</span><br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;∙ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">고급한국어1, 고급한국어2 과목은 외국인 학생만 수강신청 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">가능</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;∙ 1학년과목 중 기초수학, 기초물리학, 기초화학 및 영어읽기와 이해(34～38분반까지)과목은 신입생 기초학력과목이므로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\">수강 불가</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;∙ 그린에너지 연계전공(GEO) 및 트랙과목은 해당학생만 수강신청</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -30.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">∙ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">교직과목 수강신청자 중 논리및논술에관한교육(3학년)과목은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">전공과목에서 개설되어 있으므로, 전공별로 신청하시기 바람(2009이후 입학자 해당)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 수강신청은 매학기 18학점을 기준으로 21학점까지 신청할 수 있으며, 반드시 &nbsp;1과목 이상은 신청하여야한다. 다만, 직전학기 성적 평점평균이 4.30 이상인 자는 24학점까지 신청 가능.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4) 수강신청 시 재수강으로 표시되는 과목은 이미 취득한 과목으로서 그대로 수강신청 할 경우 수강신청 확정일(수업일수 1/4선 : 2011. 3. 28)에 기존 성적이 삭제되므로 유의</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000\"><br><br>☞2011-1학기부터 재수강과목은 A이하만 성적 취득 가능(A+ 불가)&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 2011-1학기 개설강좌내역은 [원스톱서비스-수업-개설강좌조회]메뉴 이용<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;※ 기타문의사항은 478-7029(교무연구처)</span>\n</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;478-7359(기계,정보나노,물리)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;478-7751(전자,컴퓨터,응용수학)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;478-7598(토목,건축,산업,고분자,나바텍,응용화학,경영)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학부별 연락처는 첨부물 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -27pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">교무연구처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
